#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:1
msgid "Decomposition"
msgstr "Decomposition"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`DecompositionComparator` delegates aggregating multiple objectives into "
"a single scalar value to `Decomposition`, a swappable component. "
"Approaches like MOEA/D {cite}`zhang2007moead`, which guide the search "
"using a per-subproblem weight vector, are realized by combining "
"`Decomposition` with `DecompositionComparator`."
msgstr "`DecompositionComparator`は、複数目的を1つのスカラー値へ集約する処理を、`Decomposition`という差し替え可能なコンポーネントに委ねています。 MOEA/D{cite}`zhang2007moead`のようにサブ問題ごとの重みベクトルで探索を誘導する方式は、`Decomposition`と`DecompositionComparator`を組み合わせて実現します。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:6
msgid "Decomposition's role"
msgstr "Decompositionの役割"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:8
msgid ""
"`Decomposition` requires only one method, `aggregate(f, weights, "
"ideal_point) -> np.ndarray`, to be implemented. `f` is a matrix of "
"objective values with shape `(N, n_obj)`, `weights` is a non-negative "
"weight vector with shape `(n_obj,)`, and `ideal_point` is the ideal point"
" with shape `(n_obj,)`; it returns a scalar score with shape `(N,)`. "
"Scores are unified under the convention that lower is better."
msgstr "`Decomposition`が実装を要求するメソッドは`aggregate(f, weights, ideal_point) -> np.ndarray`の1つだけです。 `f`は`shape (N, n_obj)`の目的関数値の行列、`weights`は`shape (n_obj,)`の非負の重みベクトル、`ideal_point`は`shape (n_obj,)`の理想点で、`shape (N,)`のスカラースコアを返します。 スコアは低いほど良いという慣習で統一されています。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:12
msgid ""
"`f` is passed already in a minimization frame, with the caller's "
"`DecompositionComparator` having already applied the `direction` "
"conversion. When implementing a custom `Decomposition`, you don't need to"
" apply the `direction` conversion again inside `aggregate`."
msgstr "`f`は、呼び出し側の`DecompositionComparator`が`direction`変換を適用済みの、最小化フレームである前提で渡されます。 独自の`Decomposition`を実装する際、`aggregate`の内部で改めて`direction`変換をする必要はありません。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:15
msgid "Built-in Decompositions"
msgstr "組み込みDecomposition"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "All of these are based on the MOEA/D paper {cite}`zhang2007moead`."
msgstr "いずれも{cite}`zhang2007moead`のMOEA/D論文がベースになっています。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "Characteristics"
msgstr "特徴"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "`WeightedSumDecomposition`"
msgstr "`WeightedSumDecomposition`"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid ""
"Linear weighted sum, `score = f @ weights`. Simplest, but cannot reach "
"parts of a non-convex front"
msgstr "`score = f @ weights`という線形重み付き和。最も単純だが非凸フロントの一部に到達できない"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "`TchebycheffDecomposition`"
msgstr "`TchebycheffDecomposition`"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid ""
"Chebyshev distance, `score = max_j(w_j * |f_ij - z_j*|)`. Can also reach "
"non-convex fronts"
msgstr "`score = max_j(w_j * |f_ij - z_j*|)`というChebyshev距離。非凸フロントにも到達できる"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "`PBIDecomposition`"
msgstr "`PBIDecomposition`"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid "`theta=5.0`"
msgstr "`theta=5.0`"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md
msgid ""
"`d1 + theta * d2` (projection distance along the weight-vector direction "
"+ penalty for orthogonal distance)"
msgstr "`d1 + theta * d2`（重みベクトル方向への射影距離＋直交距離のペナルティ）"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`TchebycheffDecomposition` internally substitutes `1e-6` for weights that"
" are exactly zero, since using zero directly would degenerate "
"({cite}`zhang2007moead` Appendix A's convention)."
msgstr "`TchebycheffDecomposition`は、ゼロの重みをそのまま使うと退化してしまうため、内部で`1e-6`へ置換します（{cite}`zhang2007moead` Appendix Aの慣習）。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`PBIDecomposition`'s `theta` controls the trade-off between convergence "
"(the projection distance `d1` along the weight-vector direction) and "
"diversity (the penalty on the orthogonal distance `d2`). A larger value "
"applies a stronger penalty to solutions that deviate from the weight "
"vector's direction. `theta=5.0` is the default in {cite}`zhang2007moead`."
msgstr "`PBIDecomposition`の`theta`は、収束（重みベクトル方向への射影距離`d1`）と多様性（直交距離`d2`へのペナルティ）のトレードオフを制御するパラメータです。 値が大きいほど、重みベクトルの方向から外れた解に強いペナルティがかかります。 `theta=5.0`は{cite}`zhang2007moead`の既定値です。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:31
msgid "DecompositionComparator"
msgstr "DecompositionComparator"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:33
msgid ""
"`DecompositionComparator(decomposition, weights, ideal_point=None, "
"direction=None, *, eps_cv=1e-6, eps_obj=1e-6)` implements MOEA/D-style "
"ranking as a subclass of [Comparator](comparators.md)."
msgstr "`DecompositionComparator(decomposition, weights, ideal_point=None, direction=None, *, eps_cv=1e-6, eps_obj=1e-6)`は、[Comparator](comparators.md)のサブクラスとしてMOEA/D風の順位付けを実装します。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The ordering rule prioritizes feasibility (feasibility-first "
"{cite}`deb2000feasibility`), then sorts by ascending aggregated score."
msgstr "順序付けの規則は、実行可能性を優先（feasibility-first{cite}`deb2000feasibility`）した上で、集約スコアの昇順で並べます。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:37
msgid ""
"If `ideal_point` is omitted (`None`), `sort_population` dynamically "
"computes the ideal point from the population's feasible individuals. "
"`compare`, which compares only two points, on the other hand, uses the "
"minimum of those two points' objective values as a local approximation of"
" the ideal point. These two computation methods may not fully agree."
msgstr "`ideal_point`を省略（`None`）すると、`sort_population`は個体群の実行可能個体から理想点を動的に計算します。 一方、2点だけを比較する`compare`では、その2点の目的関数値の最小値をローカルな理想点近似として使います。 この2つの計算方法は完全には一致しない場合があります。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:41
msgid ""
"`weights` carries only non-negative magnitude, with the sign "
"(minimize/maximize) expressed by `direction` — a role split corresponding"
" to the `direction`/`weight` role split described in "
"[Problem](problem.md)."
msgstr "`weights`は非負の大きさのみを持ち、符号（最小化/最大化）は`direction`が表現するという役割分担になっています。 [Problem](problem.md)の`direction`/`weight`の役割分担と対応します。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:43
msgid "Implementing a custom Decomposition"
msgstr "独自Decompositionの実装方法"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:45
msgid ""
"If you need a custom scalarization function, subclass `Decomposition` and"
" implement only `aggregate()`. The following example is a simple "
"implementation that aggregates via a weighted product (assuming all "
"objectives are positive)."
msgstr "独自のスカラー化関数が必要な場合は、`Decomposition`を継承して`aggregate()`だけを実装すればよいです。 次の例は、重み付き積で集約する（全目的が正であることを前提とする）単純な実装です。"

#: ../../../components/decomposition.md:62
msgid ""
"Since `f` is passed already converted to a minimization frame, this "
"implementation doesn't need to be aware of `direction`."
msgstr "`f`は既に最小化フレームに変換済みの値として渡されるため、この実装内で`direction`を意識する必要はありません。"

